## Architecture & Technical Stack

### Core Technologies
```
Frontend Framework: Vanilla JavaScript (no dependencies for maximum performance)
Real-Time Communication: WebSocket with fallback polling
Rendering Engine: Canvas API for sentiment visualization
Layout: CSS Grid + Flexbox hybrid
Animation: CSS transforms + requestAnimationFrame for 60fps
State Management: Event-driven architecture with pub/sub pattern
```

### File Structure
```
/static/
  /css/
    stage.css (modular, component-based styling)
  /js/
    stage-core.js (WebSocket, state management)
    sentiment-renderer.js (canvas-based heartbeat)
